sequenceDiagram
    participant Timer as 15m Sweep Timer
    participant Pool as ThreadPoolExecutor(8)
    participant APIs as 18 Geospatial & Cyber Feeds
    participant OFAC as Sanctions Matcher
    participant Delta as Sweep-Delta Engine
    participant SSE as SSE / Telegram / Discord
    Timer->>Pool: Start Sweep #N
    Pool->>APIs: Fetch Live Feeds (with TTL Cache & CircuitBreaker)
    APIs-->>Pool: Normalized Entities & Geo Tracks
    Pool->>OFAC: Match ICAO24/Tail & MMSI/IMO vs OFAC SDN
    OFAC-->>Delta: Flagged Assets & Updated Risk Scores
    Delta->>SSE: Broadcast Deltas + Geofence Breaches + SitRep
